r>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 圣启•最终审判.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/ad/8zgv5jxoxeo4ei1vofrwgrac0hvpqz5.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%9C%A3%E5%90%AF%E2%80%A2%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/ad/8zgv5jxoxeo4ei1vofrwgrac0hvpqz5.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%9C%A3%E5%90%AF%E2%80%A2%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/ad/8zgv5jxoxeo4ei1vofrwgrac0hvpqz5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />圣启•最终审判+\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>7\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-4\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓8-↑8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）选择地形格，施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">圣启•最终审判</font></span>]，于自身<font color=\"#ed7950\">7</font>次行动结束后降临（当前行动视为第1次），对目标范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内所有敌人造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">777%</font>范围伤害。<br />[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"附属被动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">附属被动</font></span></span>]，效果：<br />✦第奇数次行动开始时，积累<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次本技能使用次数（初始为0）。<br />✦释放本技能时，对范围内敌人施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"审判\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">审判</font></span></span>]（持续至战斗结束），及[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">强制直行</font></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"易伤2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">易伤2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼束缚视界2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">▼束缚视界2</font></span></span>]及[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼移动2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼移动2</font></span></span>]；自身获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲攻击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲攻击2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲暴击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲暴击2</font></span></span>]，所有效果持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-4 2.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/38/lwqu1ojcfldgefzop51w2xs2c67dnoa.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-4_2.png.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"81\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/38/lwqu1ojcfldgefzop51w2xs2c67dnoa.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-4_2.png.jpeg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/38/lwqu1ojcfldgefzop51w2xs2c67dnoa.png/160px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-4_2.png.jpeg 2x\" data-file-width=\"242\" data-file-height=\"245\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%90%A8%E6%9B%BC%E8%8E%8E%E2%80%A2%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4\" title=\"角色图鉴库/萨曼莎•审判\"><img alt=\"头像 萨曼莎•审判.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/00/tq9svs6jjaytco9y6m2ej7i1ypngce3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">萨曼莎•审判</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left; width:160px;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"skill_icon_box\">\n<div data-type=\"@悬浮框/技能2\" data-name=\"圣启•第七号角+\" class=\"bili-tt skill_icon_bg\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%9C%A3%E5%90%AF%E2%80%A2%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E5%8F%B7%E8%A7%92%2B\" title=\"技能图鉴库/圣启•第七号角+\"><img alt=\"技能背景 传说.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3d/tss9yrnhzwljv1ss561dit2j2ngoe6t.png/70px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_%E4%BC%A0%E8%AF%B4.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3d/tss9yrnhzwljv1s